      "lifetime_window": "Action driver uses actual emitted Exits, Deferred counters, effects, captured own handles; seed/control operations outside explicit read observation window. No finalExit/caseID chooses callback counts; constants native_qualified/source_grant_qualified/provider_echo label absent native/service channels, not actual SDK authorization observations.",
